      "subject": "ויקרב ka walela",
      "rationale": "An b'a faamu ko Ahaz ye kɔkɔrɔ sarakabɔlan lamini k'a bɔ a yɛrɛ ka sarakabɔlan kɔrɔ nɔ na — nka kumasen ka daɲɛ: 'a y'a lamini' walima 'a y'a to a nɔ na' (ni min bɛ jira, sira fila bɛ yen)"
