  "translation": "Ani ⟨את⟩ kɔkɔrɔ sarakabɔlan min bɛ Yawe ɲɛfɛ, a y'a walajɛ ka bɔ so ka ɲɛda fɛ, sarakabɔlan ni Yawe so cɛmajan na, a y'a bila sarakabɔlan la senfɛ, kɔrɔyan fan fɛ.",
